@startuml C4-Dynamic-MlSidecar
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Dynamic — Explore Chat calls the Explore ML app (loopback)

autonumber
actor "End User" as user
participant "Chat Web / iOS" as client <<ui>>
participant "Chat API :9001\nAiController · AiProxyService" as api <<java>>
participant "Explore ML :8000\nFastAPI main:app" as ml <<python>>
participant "ML module\nrecommendation · vision ·\nimage_playground · speech · video" as module <<python>>

user -> client: Open feed / upload image / generate media
client -> api: POST /api/v1/recommendations:rank\nvision:predict · images:generate ·\nvoices:synthesize · videos:generate
api -> api: Authenticate (Chat or IAM JWT)
api -> ml: POST EXPLORE_ML_API_URL/api/v1/feeds:rank\nimages:predict · images:generate ·\nvoices:synthesize · videos:generate
ml -> module: Route to module
module -> module: Run model (ranking, labels, generation)
module --> ml: Result JSON
ml --> api: 200 JSON
api --> client: 200 JSON

alt ML app down or error
  api --> client: 502 Upstream unavailable
  client --> user: Feature degrades; core chat still works
end

note over client, ml
  Client rule: browsers and iOS call the Chat API only, never Explore ML directly.
  Explore ML listens on loopback :8000 beside the product API; GET /health aggregates modules.
end note

@enduml
